se: Rom.11:9.†\n (AS)","source_line":575}],"occurrence_count":2,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"recompensado","count":1},{"gloss":"retribuição","count":1}]},"G4930":{"id":"G4930","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G4930","disambiguated_id":"G4930 =","unique_id":"G4930","headword":"συντέλεια","transliteration":"sunteleia","lexical_morphology":"G:N-F","gloss_en":"consummation","definition_en":"συντέλεια, -ας, ἡ\n (συντελέω), [in LXX chiefly for כָּלָה and (in Da) for קוּם ;] \n__1. in cl., a joint payment or contribution for public service; hence, generally, joint action (Plat.). \n __2. In late writers (Polyb., al.), consummation, completion: σ. τ. αἰῶνος, -ων (cf. Dan LXX TH Dan.12:13, al.), Mat.13:39-40, 49 24:3 28:20, Heb.9:26.†\n (AS)","source_line":5082}],"occurrence_count":6,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"fim","count":6}]},"G4942":{"id":"G4942","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G4942","disambiguated_id":"G4942 =","unique_id":"G4942","headword":"συνυποκρίνομαι","transliteration":"sunupokrinomai","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to join hypocrisy","definition_en":"συν-υπο-κρίνομαι \n to play a part with, dissemble with: with dative, Gal.2:13 (Polyb.).†\n (AS)","source_line":5094}],"occurrence_count":1,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"dissimularam-com","count":1}]},"G4963":{"id":"G4963","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G4963","disambiguated_id":"G4963 =","unique_id":"G4963","headword":"συστροφή","transliteration":"sustrophē","lexical_morphology":"G:N-F","gloss_en":"commotion/plot","definition_en":"συ-στροφή, -ῆς, ἡ\n (συστρέφω), [in LXX: Rom.4:19 13:12 (צָרַר); σ. ποιεῖσθαι, Amo.7:10 (קָשַׁר), etc. ;] \n__1. a twisting together (Plat.). \n __2. a concourse, a riotous gathering (Polyb.): Act.19:40; σ. ποιεῖσθαι (Am, l.with), to make a compact (RV, banded themselves together): Act.23:12.†\n (AS)","source_line":5115}],"occurrence_count":2,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"tumulto","count":1},{"gloss":"co